bam margera's life has had its ups and  downs and we're not talking about  skateboarding from hidden sex tapes to  tumultuous relationships this is the  untold truth of bam margera  margera's future as a daredevil seemed  set in stone from an early age as a  child he's said to have picked up the  habit of running straight into walls and  jumping off coffee tables in his family  home his grandfather having witnessed  this self-destructive behavior on  several occasions started to call him  bam bam which was eventually shortened  to ban the name stuck and after he  became known to millions through his  bone-crunching exploits on mtv he  decided to make it his legal name but  after completing all of the necessary  paperwork he had second thoughts about  filing it he was ultimately persuaded by  his father phil to remain legally at  least brandon cole margera  bam may not be royalty but he is the  king of his castle well sort of after  his work on tv earned him enough cash to  make his dream home a reality margera  purchased a gothic style mansion in his  home state of pennsylvania and  re-christened it castle bam adding a  host of new features to the property to  make himself and his crew of  co-conspirators more comfortable the  additions included a pirate-themed bar a  treetop casino that margera and his  friends later destroyed with cannonballs  and of course a huge skatepark  before the jackass crew formed up  margera filmed and edited his own video  series with his friends from the cky  crew the name stands for camp kill  yourself which is also the name of  margera's older brother jess's band the  latest and greatest was the last  installment in the cult video series  though it was the first one made after  marjera hit the mainstream meaning that  he had access to equipment that was  previously too expensive the production  value saw a marked improvement from  previous cky offerings though it wasn't  the shiny new look of the film that had  fans talking on some copies of the dvd  margera decided to include a clip of  himself and his then fiancee having sex  as an easter egg hidden at the end of  the movie  margera was admitted to chester county  hospital with nasty head injuries on  june 12 2010 after an altercation  outside his suburban nightclub the note  left him bleeding and unconscious on the  pavement the incident took place when  westchester resident elizabeth ray whose  home shares a wall with margera's club  saw the jackass star leave the premises  for a cigarette at around 2am and  decided to confront him about the noise  that had been keeping her awake things  escalated very quickly according to  margera's friend tammy palumbo palumbo  who was with margero when the attack  reportedly took place claims he walked  away from the argument thinking it was  over when rey cracked him over the back  of the head with a pipe-like object rey  is said to have continued her attack  verbally as palumbo cradled margera's  gashed and bloodied head supposedly  yelling quote i'll hit him again and  i'll make sure i kill him next time  margera's concussion meant he had to  miss the shooting of the epic final  scene in the jackass 3d movie in the end  rey was found guilty of aggravated  assault and reckless endangerment she  was spared prison time however with  margera himself urging the district  attorney to allow rey to serve her time  on probation after learning that she was  a caregiver for her housebound mother  after being hitched as a part of the tv  show bam's unholy union margera and  missy rothstein ended their so-called  unholy union in 2012 five years after  getting hitched in front of millions of  viewers on their mtv show margera didn't  have to wait too long to give marriage a  second shot tying the knot with nicole  boyd in 2013 during the random hero  festival an event he held in reykjavik  iceland in honor of his late friend ryan  dunn it was far from a fairytale  icelandic wedding however with the  former jackass star spending the evening  performing with his band face  unstoppable margera's wedding attire was  equally unorthodox he chose to walk down  the makeshift isle wearing a hoodie  along with something mtv described as  some kind of modified skeletor costume  from one memorable experience at an  icelandic music festival to another  margera would sooner forget in 2015  videos emerged of him being attacked by  rappers gistly palmy and eagle tiny  thorarenson in the backstage area of the  secret solstice festival with the  prominent icelandic rappers landing  several punches on margera before he was  pulled away and fell to the ground  according to a video that margera  recorded shortly after the assault the  musicians allegedly set about him at the  behest of leon hill margera's former  head of digital marketing and the  current secret solstice marketing  director margera claimed hill owed him  money and accused him of fudging the  numbers on his youtube channel hill  however responded to the allegations  with a statement of his own that  detailed the series of events leading to  the fight which he claims margera  instigated in the statement hill blames  the lack of good material from argera's  youtube channel underperforming  the tragic death of ryan dunn  understandably changed margera's life  forever the extent to which it impacted  marjera was made painfully clear when he  made his return to reality tv in 2016  appearing alongside his mother april on  the vh1 series family therapy with dr  jen during the interview margera  admitted to drinking to forget rather  than for the fun of it and revealed he'd  struggled with suicidal thoughts and  depression april margera who has  appeared numerous times in her son's  various videos and tv shows over the  years was reduced to tears as she  recounted a christmas argument in which  her son told her he would die before her  likely by drowning in his own swimming  pool  margera's time in the family therapy  house led to him getting sober for the  first time in his adult life spurred on  by the support of dr jen mann and bam's  mother april after the show wrapped  margera managed to go four months  without a drink though he fell off the  wagon while attending an art show in a  follow-up interview with vh1 april  revealed that her son slip was  orchestrated by one of his friends who  offered him a can of coke that was  actually full of booze despite the  setback she insisted that margera is  still trying to stay sober and was  considering entering himself into rehab  skater died dude i just stopped i was  like i'd rather skate  in early 2017 words surfaced that  margera was back on the skateboard after  a lengthy layoff that as he later  explained in an interview with gen chem  magazine stemmed from an assortment of  problems including bone spurs in his  feet the pressures of his celebrity  status in the skating community and the  knowledge that he couldn't safely skate  until he dealt with his drinking problem  finding himself on an editing job in  estonia during the dark of winter he  felt himself reached the end of his rope  and felt the urge to get to barcelona  for the sake of going skating he got on  a plane bought a new board and hooked up  with his friend fellow skater and  barcelona resident thomas winkle who  promptly started filming margera's  exploits  i rented a car and we just went went  from town to town meeting up with the  locals and skating everything  if that sounds like a nice vacation well  it probably was but it wasn't all fun  and games margera's skating holiday  served a larger purpose by helping him  stay sober for a while at least as he  confessed in the interview with jenkum  it's been a real struggle for me to stay  off the alcohol but just as long you're  surrounded by good people and you have  something to do you'll be good i know  being in spain is the best place for me  right now to not drink  van margera managed to get sober and  rediscover his love of skateboarding  during his time in beautiful barcelona  but addiction reared its ugly head once  more when he returned to the united  states in january 2018 the famous  daredevil got hit with a dui in  california officers noticed him using  his phone at the wheel and smelled  alcohol on his breath after pulling him  over for questioning speaking to page  six his mother april margera begged for  understanding saying don't be so quick  to judge other people everybody has a  different story and everybody is going  through different things it's not an  instant fix margera checked into rehab  for a third time following the dui  arrest for which he got probation  telling his instagram followers that he  was quote hoping the term third time as  a charm is true sadly another relapse  was just around the corner as the  one-time daredevil turned to alcohol  once more after being robbed in colombia  after arriving in cartagena alone he  claimed he got into a taxi at the  airport and then things got scary  i couldn't speak spanish they couldn't  speak english and they translated on  their phone for me to read  empty your wallet as they put a gun on  their lap  margera said he handed over 500 and was  let go he described the incident as  quote weird  bam margera was reportedly fired from  the fourth jackass film after allegedly  failing to adhere to a so-called  wellness agreement that required him to  stay sober among other conditions during  the production of the film after his  firing from the project margera filed a  lawsuit which threatened to derail the  release of the fourth jackass movie  johnny knoxville who was named in the  lawsuit told variety in an interview  that the whole affair with bam was  heartbreaking he explained we wanted him  all throughout the movie but  unfortunately that's not the way it  worked out i love bam we all love bam  he's our brother you know you just hope  that he takes it upon himself to get the  help that he needs because we all care  about him a lot  things quickly went from bad to worse  after bam margera was given the boot  from jackass forever jeff tremaine one  of the masterminds behind the franchise  and the director of the fourth jackass  film got a restraining order against his  former friend after he began threatening  him and his family legal documents seen  by people revealed bam's behavior to  remain alleged left him in great fear  for his and his family's personal safety  he told the courts adding that margera  said quote that he has powers as a  wizard and can create and strike  lightning while speaking at times using  numbers instead of english the judge  ordered marjara to stay away from  tremaine and his family for three years  some of the drama played out on social  media for the world to see when margera  said that his former friends had  betrayed abandoned and rejected him  jackass alum stevo chimed in to defend  the people he was accusing responding to  margera on social media stevo wrote bam  the two people you're saying wronged you  knoxville and tremaine are the same two  people who organized the intervention  which saved my life everyone bent over  backwards to get you in the movie and  all you had to do was not get loaded we  all love you every bit as much as we all  say we do but nobody who really loves  you can enable or encourage you to stay  sick  in december 2017 just two days before  christmas bam margera's wife nikki gave  birth to a son phoenix wolf margera in  september 2021 news broke that nikki  filed court documents asking for full  custody of their son it seems as though  the relationship fell apart following  bam's experience with addiction but  nikki doesn't appear to have given up on  him just yet tmz noted that though she  filed for custody she did not also file  for divorce which is uncommon according  to the gossip site nikki wants bam to be  able to visit their son with a monitor  present according to tmz nikki is happy  for bam to pick his own monitor but she  will have to approve of that person  first for all his troubles bam clearly  adores his son who appears regularly in  his instagram feed hopefully bam and fam  can get beyond the hard times if you or  someone you know is struggling with  addiction please call the substance  abuse and mental health administration's  24 7 national helpline at 1-800-662-help  that's 1-800-662-4357

